category: Libs
requires: libhpdf2.4 libpng-devel pkg-config zlib-devel
sdesc: "Free PDF library (development)"
ldesc: "libHaru is a free, cross platform, open source library for generating PDF
files. At this moment libHaru does not support reading and editing existing
PDF files and it's unlikely this support will ever appear."
external-source: libharu

